OL,3,GNEWSAWhy I review housing horrors on
OL,4,ATikTok
OL,5,
OL,6,FWho doesn't love a good scroll through
OL,7,FRightmove?
OL,9,FJack Bushrod has turned it into his
OL,10,Fjob, spending hours looking for unusual
OL,11,Fhomes to post on his Housing Horrors
OL,12,Faccounts on Instagram, TikTok and
OL,13,FFacebook.
OL,15,FRecent "horrors" including a
OL,16,FNottinghamshire property - dubbed "the
OL,17,Fscariest house on Rightmove" - largely
OL,18,Fdue to a creepy doll left standing in
OL,19,Fthe corner of a bedroom.
